  "description": "Hyeon Sang-Yun, a third-generation heir to a conglomerate, dreams of a carefree life as an unemployed slacker while owning buildings in Gangnam. To make that happen, he needs to slip under the chairman’s radar. He plans to escape the company by causing just enough trouble, but why does everything he does to stir up trouble end up going so well?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
